test "cve rank 162: Jenkins doFill endpoint without POST is surfaced for CSRF review"
  lang java
  expect_review code.StateChangingOp
  code
  ```
  class DescriptorImpl {
    public ListBoxModel doFillProjectItems(String aiqUrl, String login, Secret password) {
      Option[] options = getProjectOptions(aiqUrl, login, password);
      return new ListBoxModel(options);
    }
  }
  ```

test "cve rank 162: Jenkins doFill endpoint with POST is clean for CSRF review"
  lang java
  reject_review code.StateChangingOp
  code
  ```
  class DescriptorImpl {
    @POST
    public ListBoxModel doFillProjectItems(String aiqUrl, String login, Secret password) {
      Jenkins.get().checkPermission(Jenkins.ADMINISTER);
      Option[] options = getProjectOptions(aiqUrl, login, password);
      return new ListBoxModel(options);
    }
  }
  ```
